  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-21",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "茶艺社老友重逢  (Colleagues at a Garden Teahouse)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Fresh back from a relaxing break despite trailing paparazzi, singer Xin Huimei meets longtime friend Wen Simo at a classical garden teahouse and hears surprising news about his next hosting job. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "外面那几个狗仔好像还跟着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "真是讨厌，算了，让他们跟吧，我都习惯了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你这次假期过得怎么样啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "休息得挺好，身心都恢复了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我今天先带你去一家茶艺社，仿江南园林建的，环境很不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你喜欢的茶艺师我已经提前帮你约好了，就在那儿等着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你安排得够用心的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "以后咱们俩每周都会见面，我得选几个安静的好地方。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我们俩以后为什么每周都能见面？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "改版后的文娱论台里很满意，把我调过去当主持人了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "以后每周我都会去星天录节目，往后咱俩成同事了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "文娱论我去录过的，是淳于乔做的节目，这个人你见过吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "淳于乔接手了几周就让节目改头换面，我是只闻其名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "有些事，男人和女人的看法不一样，女人和女孩的看法也不一样。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "外面那几个狗仔好像还跟着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those few paparazzi outside seem to be following us still.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "真是讨厌，算了，让他们跟吧，我都习惯了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How annoying — forget it, let them follow; I am used to it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你这次假期过得怎么样啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did your holiday break go this time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "休息得挺好，身心都恢复了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I rested well, and both body and mind feel refreshed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我今天先带你去一家茶艺社，仿江南园林建的，环境很不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today I am taking you to a teahouse built like a classical garden — lovely setting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你喜欢的茶艺师我已经提前帮你约好了，就在那儿等着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I already booked your favourite tea master in advance, waiting right inside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你安排得够用心的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You put real thought into arranging everything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "以后咱们俩每周都会见面，我得选几个安静的好地方。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since the two of us will meet every week from now on, I ought to pick good quiet spots.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我们俩以后为什么每周都能见面？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why will the two of us get to see each other every week?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "改版后的文娱论台里很满意，把我调过去当主持人了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The network is pleased with the revamped Entertainment Talk and transferred me over to host it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "以后每周我都会去星天录节目，往后咱俩成同事了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every week from now on I will tape at Xingtian, making the two of us colleagues.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "文娱论我去录过的，是淳于乔做的节目，这个人你见过吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I taped an episode of Entertainment Talk before — Chun Yuqiao produces it; have you met him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "淳于乔接手了几周就让节目改头换面，我是只闻其名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao transformed the show within weeks of taking over, though I know him only by reputation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "有些事，男人和女人的看法不一样，女人和女孩的看法也不一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On some matters, men and women see things differently, and women and young girls differ too.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
